      "side": 1,
      "message": "ldap_modify can raise NO_SUCH_OBJECT if the role itself exists but never were granted to any user in this tenant.\nrole_dn is DN like cn\u003dmyrole,cn\u003dthetenant,\u003ctenant_tree_dn\u003e\n\nAbsence of such object might mean that:\n- either there is no such tenant at all\n- or there is no such role at all\n- or this user hadn\u0027t been granted this role in this tenant (and no user ever had).\n\nSQL backend raises RoleNotFound for all these cases. I think, more precise error diagnosis is better.",
